  "content": "<div>\n    <p><br><br></p>\n    <center>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e0apuWp.png\" alt=\"Creatures and Beasts 作品標誌\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6nOSDaZ.png\" alt=\"Creatures and Beasts 展示\">\n\n<div>\n    <p><br><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" alt=\"關於\">\n      <p><br></p>\n                <p>Creatures and Beasts 是一款奇幻生物模組，為每個生態域增添新生物，從主世界的平原到終界的虛空！</p>\n      <p><br></p>\n                <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/XzTm4k5FRJY\" title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" alt=\"致謝\">\n        <p><br></p>\n        <dl>\n            <dt>Josh/Joosh - 美術</dt>\n            <dt>HellionGames - 模組編寫</dt>\n            <dt>Christian#9544 和 AzureDoom#3690 - 程式碼貢獻</dt>\n        </dl>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>    \n\n**<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" alt=\"我們的其他作品\">**\n\n[**Creeper Overhaul**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/creeper-overhaul) 一個全面翻新原版苦力怕的模組！<br>\n[**Critters and Companions**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/critters-and-companions) 一個增添各種友好動物的模組！<br>\n[**Ghost**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/ghost) 一個為你的世界添加兩種友善幽靈生物的模組！<br>\n[**Golem Overhaul**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/golem-overhaul) 一個新增 9 種鐵魔像類型的模組！<br>\n[**Enderman Overhaul**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/enderman-overhaul) 一個全面翻新原版終界使者的模組！<br>\n[**Nightlights**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/nightlights) 一個為 Minecraft 增添多種新光源的模組！<br>\n[**Lookin' sharp**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/lookin-sharp) 為遊戲新增 60 種近戰武器！<br>\n[**Ribbits**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/ribbits) Ribbits 新增充滿青蛙村民的沼澤村莊！</p>\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"Discord\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"Twitter\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" alt=\"YouTube\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/bonsaistudios\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" alt=\"Kofi\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://mcmodels.net/vendors/29/joosh\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" alt=\"Mcmodels\">\n        </a>\n    </center> <br>\n<div>",
